               <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_0537d9f0">1 bifolio. Written in ink. Paper: 17 staves as the lower part of the last stave has been cut away.  Heading on fol.1<rend xml:id="idm36" rend="sup">r</rend>: "N.W. Gade" in foreign hand. Heading on fol.1<rend xml:id="idm37" rend="sup">v</rend>: "Kjøge. Sang af Ingemann". In the upper right-hand corner: "Gade" added in pencil in foreign hand. On staves 1-6 version for mixed choir end-dated "Martz 1843. N.W. Gade". On staves 7-10 version for male choir in F major and on staves 11-16 piano accompaniment. After the final bar: "Venskabelig / Hilsen fra / N.W. Gade".</physMedium>
